d not as sweet. I enjoyed every spoonful! There are so many flavors to choose from. You can select individual flavors or the mixed flavors for an additional charge. The business is tucked away, I passed it up because I arrived before opening and the signs weren't out yet. This was the perfect treat, I can't wait to return to try other flavors. I had Strawberry Lemonade and peach, I liked peach the best! Until we meet again! #blackownedbusiness"},{"business_id":"Ytx9g0kPr09XxdLW9bUsgQ","review_id":"pwV-1aeJ5E0s9wYfH2VLeA","date":"2021-07-31T23:26:33","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.8943302631378174,"text_excerpt":"Very refreshing. The ice was nice and smooth and the flavors were spot on. Great treat for a hot day!"}],"visual":[]},"notebook_case":null}
